<title>FINLAND: ALCOM SEES 1997 LOSS.</title>
<headline>ALCOM SEES 1997 LOSS.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish data system group Alcom Oy said on Tuesday it expects its earnings to remain in the red in 1997.</p>
<p>&quot;The group's budgeted result for 1997 is negative,&quot; Alcom said in a statement with its 1996 report.</p>
<p>Alcom's 1996 loss before appropriations and taxes was 2.4 million markka, up from a 39.6 million markka loss in 1995.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-6805 0248</p>
